         ${misc:Depends}
Description: PolarisOS system identity and branding
 Installs the PolarisOS identity on top of Debian:
  - its own /usr/lib/os-release (Debian's file is diverted with dpkg-divert
    so base-files upgrades do not overwrite it)
  - wallpaper, logo and boot splash artwork
  - login screen appearance (LightDM)
  - default theme and icons at the first Xfce login
  - polaris-check: reports RAM, boot time, firewall, AppArmor and zram
  - polaris-bluetooth-applet: starts the Bluetooth applet only when
    Bluetooth hardware is present
